param=bslay_tactic_text,Zamorak conjures a huge rune and channels power through its markings. Standing on the rune's markings will cause the target to take damage. Within the safe space, black flames will rotate around, alternating directions periodically. If the black smoke catches targets, after two hits of damage the target will be stunned.<br><br>Damage from this attack is scaled with Enrage %.
