param=timed_event_long_desc,<col=531502>Santa has gone on his annual holiday, before the usual Christmas rush. Unfortunately the imps are jealous and have run amok!<br><col=531502>Santa's helpers have stolen the pieces of clockwork needed for this year's new toy. Help Eira, Santa's head elf, collect them all back up again, and save Christmas.<br><col=531502>Collect clockwork pieces through skilling, combat and daily challenges and return them to Eira for your rewards.<br><col=531502>The naughty snow imps can also be spotted around the world. Catch them for additional clockwork pieces.
