param=task_rewards,Gives points, which can be exchanged for <col=ffffff>experience</col> or <col=ffffff>money</col>. Spotting penguins also allows you to upgrade the <col=ffffff>penguin spy device</col> and unlock <col=ffffff>cosmetic rewards</col>.
param=task_step_1,Talk to <col=ffffff>Larry</col> or <col=ffffff>Chuck</col> at <col=ffffff>Ardougne Zoo</col> to learn more.
param=task_step_2,You may spy on each penguin <col=ffffff>once per week</col>, and each week they all move.
param=task_step_1_arrow,0_40_51_36_2
param=task_step_2_arrow,0_40_51_36_2
param=task_auto_arrow,1
param=task_icon,"task_icons_48_60,7"
