[task_tut3_rotate_camera]
param=task_name,Rotate Your Camera
param=task_details,Welcome to RuneScape.<br><br>You control your camera view using the arrow keys.<br><br>Pan the camera round until you can see the knight at the door of the room you are in.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
