// 1709
[task_tut3_open_journal]
param=task_name,Check your Quest Journal
param=task_details,Open the Quest Journal interface to see your current quest progress. Click on an entry in the list to see what you should be doing to progress in that quest.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons2,0"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3506
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,You are now on a quest to deal with the dragon. For more information, click on the Quest List tab on the side bar...
param=task_step_2,...and then on the Unstable Foundations entry to view your Quest Journal.
param=task_next_id,3508
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1710
[task_tut3_use_worldmap]
param=task_name,Check your World Map
param=task_details,Before you go off to drug the dragon, check your surroundings. The minimap in the top-right of the screen gives a general picture; for more detail, open the world map by clicking on the globe icon.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons2,1"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3508
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,Check the minimap in the top-right corner of the screen to see a plan of the cellar.
param=task_step_2,For a more complete picture of the area, click on the globe button next to the minimap.
param=task_step_3,The world map will show you many other places once you are free of this cellar.
param=task_next_id,3509
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1711
[task_tut3_realign_map]
param=task_name,Realign your Minimap
param=task_details,Set your camera view and minimap alignment back to face North, by clicking on the compass icon next to your minimap.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons2,2"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3509
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,Clicking on the compass arrow on the other side of the minimap from the World Map button will cause your camera and minimap to face due North.
param=task_next_id,3507
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1712
[task_tut3_climb_wall]
param=task_name,Climb the Wall
param=task_details,You must get past the dragon.<br><br>Take some drugged meat from Sir Vant's bag, then find a way to climb over the broken wall near Sir Vant into the main room of the cellar.<br><br>For more information on this Task, click on the Hints tab above.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons2,3"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3507
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,Pick up some drugged meat from Sir Vant's bag by clicking on it.
param=task_step_1_arrow,0_99_99_0_39
param=task_step_2,The wall is too high to climb without aid.
param=task_step_3,There is a plank next to the wall; click on it to pick it up.
param=task_step_3_arrow,0_99_99_0_37
param=task_next_id,3523
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1713
[task_tut3_make_ramp]
param=task_name,Make a Ramp
param=task_details,The wall is too high to climb without aid. Click on the plank in your inventory to select it, then on the wall to construct a ramp.<br><br>For more information on this Task, click on the Hints tab above.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons2,3"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3523
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,In your inventory, click on the plank to select it (or right-click and select 'Use').
param=task_step_1_arrow,0_99_99_0_1
param=task_step_2,With the plank selected, click on the low wall to place it. Once you have placed the plank down, you will be able to climb the wall by clicking on it.
param=task_step_2_arrow,0_99_99_0_38
param=task_next_id,3510
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1714
[task_tut3_drug_dragon]
param=task_name,Put the Dragon to Sleep
param=task_details,Search the cellar to locate the dragon's food bowl and put the drugged meat in it.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons2,4"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3510
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,Explore the cellar until you find the food bowl.
param=task_step_2,Use the food on the bowl to aid Sir Vant with his plan (make sure to right-click and select 'Use').
param=task_next_id,3511
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1715
[task_tut3_talk_to_sir_vant_4]
param=task_name,Talk to Sir Vant Again
param=task_details,Sir Vant has joined you by the pillars. Talk to him to discover the next step of the plan.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons1,3"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3511
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,Sir Vant has moved; you can now find him by the wooden pillar just south-east of the dragon's nest.
param=task_next_id,3512
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1716
[task_tut3_sabotage_pillar]
param=task_name,Sabotage!
param=task_details,Set Sir Vant's trap by tying an oily rag around each pillar and adding a fuse.<br><br>Once you have done this, give Sir Vant a tinderbox and light the fuse on the right.<br><br>For more information on this Task, click on the Hints tab above.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons1,4"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3512
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,To rip the cloth into strips, simply left-click on it in your inventory.
param=task_step_2,Use each cloth on the oil can to soak it in oil, then on a pillar to set in place.
param=task_step_2_arrow,0_99_99_0_40
param=task_step_3,Once the cloth is in place, use the fuse on it to ready the trap.
param=task_step_4,You can then give a tinderbox to Sir Vant by clicking on it in your inventory and using it on him.
param=task_step_4_arrow,0_99_99_0_41
param=task_step_5,Once all is ready, use the tinderbox on the pillar to light the fuse, then run for cover!
param=task_next_id,3513
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1717
[task_tut3_return_gear]
param=task_name,Return the Squire's Gear
param=task_details,Sir Vant will need to return the squire's weapons and armour to the family. Take them off and give them to him.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons1,8"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3513
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,Take off your armour and weapons by opening the worn equipment tab and clicking on them.
param=task_step_1_arrow,0_99_99_0_2
param=task_step_2,Right-click on the items in your inventory and choose Use, then click on Sir Vant to hand back the kit.
param=task_step_2_arrow,0_99_99_0_1
param=task_next_id,3514
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1718
[task_tut3_discover_exit]
param=task_name,Discover an Exit
param=task_details,The dragon's breath burned away the ladder to the surface.<br><br>Locate another way out - the man you rescued may be able to advise you.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons2,6"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3514
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,The ladder in the starting room is gone, but you may be able to use the ladder in the cellar of the connected house, if you can reach it.
param=task_step_2,You'll need to exploit a weak spot in the wall between the two cellars in order to make further progress.
param=task_step_3,Talk to Roddeck, the man who just came out of the cupboard, to seek his input.
param=task_step_3_arrow,0_99_99_0_42
param=task_next_id,3515
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1719
[task_tut3_cutting_path]
param=task_name,Cutting a Path
param=task_details,Use a woodcutting hatchet to clear the roots blocking the right-hand path out of the cellar.<br><br>You now have two Tasks: click on the Back button above or the Task System icon to view both, then on one of the icons displayed to find out more.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons2,7"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3515
param=task_area,60
param=task_optional,1
param=task_step_1,The exit route you have chosen is blocked by thick roots. In order to clear them, you will need a hatchet; simply click on them to attempt to cut through.
param=task_step_1_arrow,0_99_99_0_43
param=task_next_id,3516
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1720
[task_tut3_breaking_through]
param=task_name,Breaking Through
param=task_details,Use a mining pickaxe to clear the rubble blocking the left-hand path out of the cellar.<br><br>You now have two Tasks: click on the Back button above or the Task System icon to view both, then on one of the icons displayed to find out more.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons2,8"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3516
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,The exit route you have chosen is blocked by rubble. In order to clear it, you will need a pickaxe; simply click on the rubble to attempt to break through it.
param=task_step_1_arrow,0_99_99_0_44
param=task_next_id,3517
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1721
[task_tut3_woodcutting_lvl2]
param=task_name,Skill in Woodcutting
param=task_details,Clearing the roots requires level 2 Woodcutting. Find a way to attain this; Roddeck may have some useful advice.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons1,11"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3517
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,It seems that cutting through a tangle of roots is a harder job than it looked. You'll need to get in some practice in order to be up to the task.
param=task_step_2,On another wall nearby is a spot where weaker roots have breached the cellar walls. Click on them, or use your hatchet on them, to cut them and practice the art of woodcutting.
param=task_step_2_arrow,0_99_99_0_45
param=task_step_3,Each root knole you successfully chop will yield some chippings and 42 experience. The chippings are useless to you and can be safely dropped on the floor using their right-click option.
param=task_step_4,Gaining 83 experience from cutting the roots will allow you to reach level 2 and be ready to deal with the major root blockage.
param=task_next_id,3518
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1722
[task_tut3_mining_lvl2]
param=task_name,Skill in Mining
param=task_details,Clearing the rubble requires level 2 Mining. Find a way to attain this; Roddeck may have some useful advice.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons2,10"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3518
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,It seems that smashing through solid rock is a harder job than it looked. You'll need to get in some practice in order to be up to the task.
param=task_step_2,On the ground nearby is a spot where stone has fallen from the ceiling. Click on it, or use your pick on it, to hack at it and practice the art of mining.
param=task_step_2_arrow,0_99_99_0_46
param=task_step_3,Each lump of rock you successfully shatter will yield some chippings and 42 experience. The chippings are useless to you and can be safely dropped on the floor using their right-click option.
param=task_step_4,Gaining 83 experience from breaking the stone will allow you to reach level 2 and be ready to deal with the major rubble blockage.
param=task_optional,1
param=task_next_id,3519
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1723
[task_tut3_leave_cellar]
param=task_name,To Freedom!
param=task_details,Leave the cellar via the ladder under Explorer Jack's house.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons1,6"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3519
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,By clearing a path into Explorer Jack's cellar you have opened a route to the outside world.
param=task_step_2,Depart up the ladder to the surface.
param=task_step_2_arrow,0_99_99_0_47
param=task_next_id,3520
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1724
[task_tut3_debriefing]
param=task_name,Introducing...Explorer Jack
param=task_details,Talk to Explorer Jack about the world outside.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons2,9"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3520
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,Explorer Jack can tell you more about the Tasks and other possible goals available to you outside. Talk to him before you go.
param=task_next_id,3521
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

// 1725
[task_tut3_completed]
param=task_name,The Journey Begins
param=task_details,You may now leave Explorer Jack's house and begin your own explorations.
param=task_rewards,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=task_icon,"task_tutorial_icons1,7"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3521
param=task_area,60
param=task_step_1,Good luck and have fun!
param=task_optional,1
param=task_next_id,349
param=task_game,1
param=task_optional,1

