// 2756
[dom_boss_nomad]
param=dom_boss_name,Nomad
param=dom_boss_id,1
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_nomad_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_nomad_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,37
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,31
param=dom_arena_type,4
param=dom_boss_desc,Nomad is an incredibly proud warrior. He doesn't think twice at killing others or even harvesting the souls of innocents. Probably best to not mention that he's somewhat bald.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Nomad's Requiem<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: As the final boss in a high-level quest he offers a horrific battle involving duplicates of himself, proximity mines, and a devastating attack from which you'd better try to hide. Plus, he replenishes his own health. He also has an attack where he teleports you into the centre of the arena, freezes you and proceeds to take away all your life points except 1.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Prepare to meet death
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,nomad_prepare_to_meet_death
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,nomad_prepare_to_meet_death
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,nomad_prepare_to_meet_death
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,nomad_prepare_to_meet_death
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,90000
param=dom_boss_spline_size,0
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_nomad

// 2757
[dom_boss_pest_queen]
param=dom_boss_name,Pest Queen (+ Drones)
param=dom_boss_id,2
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_pest_queen_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_pest_queen_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,28
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,30
param=dom_arena_type,2
param=dom_boss_desc,This giant monster is a mother to the pests that plague the void knights. Big, squirmy, and covered in eyes and tentacles; it's best not to get too close!<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: The Void Stares Back<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: She spawns drones that, in turn, spawn defilers. You must keep the queen's helpers at bay so your fellow knights can stop the queen from healing herself. You need to use the special attack of Korasi's sword (provided in the arena) to stop the queen from obliterating the knights.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Gnraar
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,pest_queen_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,pest_queen_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,pest_queen_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,pest_queen_taunt
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,100000
param=dom_boss_spline_size,2
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_pest_queen_drone

// 2758
[dom_boss_decaying_avatar]
param=dom_boss_name,Decaying Avatar
param=dom_boss_id,3
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_decaying_avatar_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_decaying_avatar_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,35
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,29
param=dom_arena_type,1
param=dom_boss_desc,Probably the tallest monster ever to exist, this lumbering beast embodies destruction and decay.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Nomad's Requiem<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: A fearsome foe that replenishes his health from the roots that appear around the arena. Remove the roots to avoid the avatar replenishing itself and the fight taking longer than it needs to.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Grrr
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,decaying_avatar_defend_1
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,decaying_avatar_defend_1
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,decaying_avatar_defend_1
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,decaying_avatar_defend_1
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,42000
param=dom_boss_spline_size,1
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_decaying_avatar

// 2759
[dom_boss_eruni_ayuni_leeuni]
param=dom_boss_name,Eruni, Ayuni and Leeuni
param=dom_boss_id,4
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_eruni_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_2,dom_ayuni_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_3,dom_leeuni_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_apmeken_eruni_shield_combat
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_2,dom_ayuni_combat
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_3,dom_leeuni_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,35
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,32
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_x,35
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_z,29
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc3_x,38
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc3_z,30
param=dom_arena_type,4
param=dom_boss_desc,These beasts were created by Amascut who stole the hearing, sound and sight of Apmeken in order to create the deadly trio. There's something incredibly creepy about a foe who hides their face behind a mask...<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Do no Evil<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Fight these three together you'll have several things to worry about. Ayuni will teleport towards you if you get too far away; attacks with melee and magic and will drain your prayer. Leeuni attacks with melee and magic and will teleport to get up close and personal should you stray too far away. Leeuni will also remove any helmet should you choose to wear one. Eruni attacks with magic and is invincible while there are any demons around (oh yes, by the way you have to fight demons at the same time).
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Do you hear that? Sounds like defeat
param=dom_boss_2_taunt,Iiii see you
param=dom_boss_3_taunt,Delicious, tasty mortal
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,leeuni_ayuni_eruni_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,leeuni_ayuni_eruni_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,leeuni_ayuni_eruni_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,leeuni_ayuni_eruni_taunt
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,45000
param=dom_boss_spline_size,0
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_ay_er_le

// 2760
[dom_boss_zenevivia]
param=dom_boss_name,Zenevivia
param=dom_boss_id,5
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_zenevivia_battle_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_zenevivia_battle_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,38
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,32
param=dom_arena_type,5
param=dom_boss_desc,A sweetheart of the Wise Old Man. With her love of combat she is ready to show just how mean she can be!<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Love Story<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: During her onslaught, she teleports around to pedestals, and you should knock her off these in order to damage her. Watch out for her spawning fire. At least the Wise Old Man is there to help!
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Be prepared to meet your maker!
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,zeneviva_meet_your_maker
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,zeneviva_meet_your_maker
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,zeneviva_meet_your_maker
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,zeneviva_meet_your_maker
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,30000
param=dom_boss_spline_size,0
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_zenevivia

// 2761
[dom_boss_second_dagannoth_mother]
param=dom_boss_name,Dagannoth Mother (Version 2)
param=dom_boss_id,6
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_second_dagannoth_mother_grey_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_second_dagannoth_mother_grey_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,36
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,30
param=dom_arena_type,3
param=dom_boss_desc,One of the most dangerous types of dagannoth, she is the daughter of the first dagannoth to terrorise the Fremennik. Through many generations they have developed a unique set of defensive and offensive abilities. Beware!<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Blood Runs Deep<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: To start with, you'll need to hit her with Balmung (weapon provided in arena), then she will switch at random between different combat types, requiring you to use different attack styles to deal damage to her. Be prepared to use melee, ranged and magic attacks unless you fancy a very long battle. She will attack with magic, melee and ranged attacks. You'll need to remember: blue (water magic); orange (melee attacks); green (ranged attacks); brown (earth magic); red (fire magic); white (air magic).<br><br>If you don't have the normal spellbook active, it will become active when you start this battle, and will revert afterwards.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Raaaa
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,dagganoth_mother_changes_1
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,dagganoth_mother_changes_1
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,dagganoth_mother_changes_1
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,dagganoth_mother_changes_1
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,17500
param=dom_boss_spline_size,0
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_second_dagannoth_mother

// 2762
[dom_boss_untouchable]
param=dom_boss_name,The Untouchable
param=dom_boss_id,7
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_untouchable_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_untouchable_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,37
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,31
param=dom_arena_type,1
param=dom_boss_desc,A figment of your imagination, this creature thrives on being practically impossible to injure. Its gelatinous quality means it's difficult to deal an impact. And anyone fighting it ends up all slimy.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Dream Mentor<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Fights using melee only but takes a fair amount to get in a hit. At least good old Cyrisus is there to help a little.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Grrrr
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,untouchable_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,untouchable_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,untouchable_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,untouchable_taunt
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,10000
param=dom_boss_spline_size,0
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_untouchable

// 2763
[dom_boss_damis_fareed_kamil_dessous]
param=dom_boss_name,Damis, Fareed, Kamil and Dessous
param=dom_boss_id,8
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_damis_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_2,dom_fareed_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_3,dom_kamil_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_4,dom_dessous_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_damis_combat
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_2,dom_fareed_combat
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_3,dom_kamil_combat
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_4,dom_dessous_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,38
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,33
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_x,37
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_z,32
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc3_x,37
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc3_z,31
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc4_x,38
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc4_z,30
param=dom_arena_type,2
param=dom_boss_desc,These four foes feature as guardians to four diamonds used to gain entrance to a pyramid in the Kharidian desert.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Desert Treasure<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: You need to fight this dangerous quartet together. Damis has two versions that you must defeat and attacks with melee. Fareed will penalise anyone not wearing ice gloves, attacking with his magic fire attacks. Kamil fights with magic and will occasionally freeze you. Dessous will make use of his patented bat attack to deal magic and ranged damage, should you choose to use one of those protection prayers.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Attack!
param=dom_boss_2_taunt,Don't let it leave this place
param=dom_boss_3_taunt,Kill!
param=dom_boss_4_taunt,We will destroy you
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,damis_fareed_kamil_dessous_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,damis_fareed_kamil_dessous_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,damis_fareed_kamil_dessous_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,damis_fareed_kamil_dessous_taunt
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,24500
param=dom_boss_spline_size,0
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,domtower_icon_4_guardians

// 2764
[dom_boss_everlasting_illusive]
param=dom_boss_name,The Everlasting and The Illusive
param=dom_boss_id,9
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_everlasting_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_2,dom_illusive_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_everlasting_combat
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_2,dom_illusive_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,37
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,31
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_x,38
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_z,30
param=dom_arena_type,2
param=dom_boss_desc,These two creatures are the stuff of (very bizarre) dreams. One of them tries very little to avoid confrontation but is incredibly tough, whereas the other is a nuisance to chase down yet can be killed with a couple of blows.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Dream Mentor<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: One very tough, one tricky to reach. They both attack with melee, but you'll have Cyrisus with you to help out a bit.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Roarrrr
param=dom_boss_2_taunt,Squeek
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,everlasting_illusive_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,everlasting_illusive_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,everlasting_illusive_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,everlasting_illusive_taunt
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,19700
param=dom_boss_spline_size,0
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_everlasting_illusive

// 2765
[dom_boss_dagannoth_sentinels]
param=dom_boss_name,Dagannoth Sentinels
param=dom_boss_id,10
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_sentinel_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_2,dom_sentinel_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_sentinel_combat
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_2,dom_sentinel_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,37
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,32
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_x,37
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_z,29
param=dom_arena_type,2
param=dom_boss_desc,These chaps are so identical they must be closely related! They are of the race of sea creatures that cause havoc for the Fremennik.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Blood Runs Deep<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: These bad boys work as a fearsome pair. They will restore each other's health if you concentrate on one for too long. They attack with a mixture of melee, magic and ranged.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Grrr
param=dom_boss_2_taunt,Rawr
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,dagganoth_mother_changes_2
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,dagganoth_mother_changes_2
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,dagganoth_mother_changes_2
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,dagganoth_mother_changes_2
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,24000
param=dom_boss_spline_size,0
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_dagannoth_sentinels

// 2766
[dom_boss_karamel_gelatinnoth_mother]
param=dom_boss_name,Karamel and Gelatinnoth Mother
param=dom_boss_id,11
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_karamel_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_2,dom_gelatannoth_mother_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_karamel_combat
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_2,dom_gelatannoth_mother_air_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,38
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,30
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_x,37
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_z,31
param=dom_arena_type,2
param=dom_boss_desc,These two creatures are creations of the Culinaromancer. One's a karamel treat, the other a jelly, so if a warrior is not hungry before fighting them, they may be afterwards.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Recipe for Disaster<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Karamel will attack you with melee and mage attacks, reacting to the protection prayers you have active. She will also freeze you occasionally. The gelatinnoth mother works much like dagannoths, switching between the following states for you to attack by: blue (water magic); orange (melee attacks); green (ranged attacks); brown (earth magic); red (fire magic); white (air magic). She uses ranged attacks. Tasty.<br><br>If you don't have the normal spellbook active, it will become active when you start this battle, and will revert afterwards.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Well hello, sweetie.
param=dom_boss_2_taunt,Graaar
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,gelatinoth_karamel_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,gelatinoth_karamel_taunt
