param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_inadequacy_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_inadequacy_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,35
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,29
param=dom_arena_type,2
param=dom_boss_desc,Does this beast really exist? Only in our imaginations! The writhing blob with eyes feeds on people's insecurities and hits them with doubts.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Dream Mentor<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: The Inadequacy has aggressive ranged and melee attacks but also spawns doubts to deal you extra damage. At least Cyrisus is there to help a little.
