param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,38
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,32
param=dom_arena_type,1
param=dom_boss_desc,Born a Fremennik, he'll die a Fremennik as he puts people to the test of their combat prowess. He doesn't like it when people look him straight in the eyes for too long.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Fremennik Trials<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: This aggressive warrior has four forms that he will go through, each more dangerous than the next. He attacks only with melee so hopefully you can easily beat him.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Hahahahaha
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,koschei_hahaha
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,koschei_hahaha
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,koschei_hahaha
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,koschei_hahaha
