param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,38
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,32
param=dom_arena_type,1
param=dom_boss_desc,He's the avatar of the Arzinian of Bordanzan. This being was created with one goal in mind - that of protection and it doesn't hold any conflicting emotions or agendas so fights with true determination.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Between a Rock<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: This holy avatar will fight you using fire-based magic. This time around the amount of gold ore you're carrying won't make a difference. It's on the tower's terms and not his!
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Die foolish mortal
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,silence
