// 2799
[dom_boss_sigmund]
param=dom_boss_name,Sigmund
param=dom_boss_id,44
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_sigmund_showdown_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_sigmund_showdown_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,38
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,32
param=dom_arena_type,1
param=dom_boss_desc,This balding man is a senior member of H.A.M. and has a vicious hatred for goblins, particularly those living near his place of work at Lumbridge Castle: the Dorgeshuun. If anyone can earn the title of a 'bad guy', Sigmund can.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Chosen Commander<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Seemingly to spite you as well as protect himself, Sigmund uses protection prayers against melee, ranged and magic based on how you attack him. To make things easier, you'll need to use the special attack of the ancient mace (provided in the arena) to reduce his prayer points. With the 'no ultimate abilities' handicap, you'll only have a brief time to injure him before he replenishes his prayer points.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,We meet again!
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,sigmund_we_meet_again
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,sigmund_we_meet_again
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,sigmund_we_meet_again
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,sigmund_we_meet_again
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,10000
param=dom_boss_spline_size,0
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_sigmund

// 2800
[dom_boss_melzar_the_mad]
param=dom_boss_name,Melzar the Mad
param=dom_boss_id,45
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_melzar_the_mad_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_melzar_the_mad_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,38
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,32
param=dom_arena_type,3
param=dom_boss_desc,Originally a citizen of Crandor, Melzar was chased away by Elvarg. In his incredibly intricate and over-engineered maze he went quite crazy. Once upon a time, he was determined to restore his former friends and allies to life after the massacre on Crandor, but he now appears to be more obsessed with cabbages.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Dragon Slayer<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Surely you remember this mad geezer! In-between shouting random abuse, he'll cast a fire magic attack; 'zap' you; punch you; reduce your strength and summon cabbages.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Cabbage stew!
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,melzar_cabbage_stew
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,melzar_cabbage_stew
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,melzar_cabbage_stew
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,melzar_cabbage_stew
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,2800
param=dom_boss_spline_size,0
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_melzar

// 2801
[dom_boss_count_draynor]
param=dom_boss_name,Count Draynor
param=dom_boss_id,46
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_count_draynor_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_count_draynor_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,38
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,32
param=dom_arena_type,1
param=dom_boss_desc,To his mates he's known as Victor (not that he probably has many). He was a follower of Zaros before he tried to kill him in an act of allegiance to Zamorak, but when Zaros was defeated he swapped back to following Zamorak. His hobbies include preying on naive travellers that visit Draynor Manor, practicing long theatrical speeches and fashion.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Vampyre Slayer<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: A stake through the heart, sunlight, garlic; all items on the count's least favourite list. He attacks with melee and you need to be carrying a stake and hammer (items provided in arena) when dealing the killing blow.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Mmmm. I can smell your blood!
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,count_draynor_smell_your_blood
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,count_draynor_smell_your_blood
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,count_draynor_smell_your_blood
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,count_draynor_smell_your_blood
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,4000
param=dom_boss_spline_size,0
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_count_draynor
param=dom_boss_death_spotnim,spotanim_1959

// 2802
[dom_boss_delrith]
param=dom_boss_name,Delrith
param=dom_boss_id,47
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_delrith_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_delrith_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,37
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,31
param=dom_arena_type,1
param=dom_boss_desc,This demon was summoned to destroy Varrock only to be thwarted by... a talented adventurer. Not many people know that he originated in the infernal dimensions as a demon lord. Hopefully this time around any adventurer will find it easier.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Demon Slayer<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: A Demon with devilish melee attacks! This demon can only be banished by dealing the killing blow with Silverlight (weapon provided in arena).
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Grrrrr
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,greater_demon_attack_5
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,greater_demon_attack_5
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,greater_demon_attack_5
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,greater_demon_attack_5
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,3000
param=dom_boss_spline_size,0
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_delrith

// 2803
[dom_boss_solus_dellagar]
param=dom_boss_name,Solus Dellagar
param=dom_boss_id,48
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_solus_dellagar_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_solus_dellagar_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,38
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,32
param=dom_arena_type,3
param=dom_boss_desc,He may be a simple-looking mage but warriors shouldn't be fooled - he is a mass murderer and shows no sympathy for his fellow man. That, combined with the fact that there are few other mortals with his command of magic, makes him a deadly man, although hopefully not to anyone in this tower!<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Wanted<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Despite his classic wizard fashion style, Solus simply attacks with melee using his staff. Maybe he's feeling ill.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Face the wrath of my powerful magic
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,solus_feel_the_wrath
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,solus_feel_the_wrath
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,solus_feel_the_wrath
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,solus_feel_the_wrath
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,6800
param=dom_boss_spline_size,0
param=dom_boss_thumbnail,aif_dom_solus_dellagar

