param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,39
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,34
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_x,40
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_z,34
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc3_x,41
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc3_z,33
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc4_x,41
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc4_z,32
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc5_x,38
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc5_z,31
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc6_x,41
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc6_z,31
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc7_x,39
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc7_z,30
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc8_x,40
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc8_z,30
param=dom_arena_type,2
param=dom_boss_desc,Picture the scene: It's a dark and rainy day, and you're bravely fending off a gang of low-lifes. You're battered and exhausted, but you've put up a good fight and the enemy is hurting too... Who will win. You? (The good guy). Them? (The bad guys). Go on; shake your fists at the sky then finish them off! Arghhhh!<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: You must simultaneously fight the following bosses: Arrav, Koschei the Deathless, General Khazard, Black Knight Guardian, The Kendal, The Black Golem, The White Golem, and The Grey Golem. Each of them will have only 20% of their life points remaining and it's up to you to finish them off.<br><br>As it's a multi-way combat arena you will be under attack by all of them. You will also have the following handicaps active: No prayers; reduced melee, range, and magic defence; poisoned; no ultimate abilities; random daze and no power-ups.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quests required to play</col>: Curse of Arrav, Fremennik Trials, Fight Arena, A Void Dance, Mountain Daughter and Spirits of the Elid.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Get the idiot!
param=dom_boss_2_taunt,Hit it in the face!
param=dom_boss_3_taunt,Muahahah!
param=dom_boss_4_taunt,Smash its bones
param=dom_boss_5_taunt,You're dead meat!
param=dom_boss_6_taunt,Stab!
param=dom_boss_7_taunt,Slash!
param=dom_boss_8_taunt,Crush!
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,finish_him_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,finish_him_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,finish_him_taunt
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,finish_him_taunt
param=dom_battle_total_lifepoints,32875
param=dom_boss_spline_size,1

