param=dom_npc_spawn_npc4_x,39
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc4_z,29
param=dom_arena_type,2
param=dom_boss_desc,What if all the dagannoth bosses were fought in one go? Switching combat styles and surviving is no easy feat. A warrior could, in theory, defeat them using one combat style, but it would certainly be no quick battle, if possible at all!<br><br>You will be pitched against: the original dagannoth mother, the second dagannoth mother and 2 dagannoth sentinels; all at once.<br><br>If you don't have the normal spellbook active, it will become active when you start this battle, and will revert afterwards.<br><br>There are no handicaps applied.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quests required to play</col>: Horror from the Deep, Blood Runs Deep.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Grrrr
param=dom_boss_2_taunt,Rraaaa
param=dom_boss_3_taunt,Rrrrr
param=dom_boss_4_taunt,Grrr
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,dagganoths_group
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,dagganoths_group
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,dagganoths_group
