// 3107
[task_guards_and_robbers]
param=task_game,2
param=task_name,Heist
param=task_details,Attempt to deceive other players in order to steal loot as a robber, or protect the island as a guard.
param=task_rewards,Gives <col=ffffff>reward points</col>, which can be exchanged for <col=ffffff>Thieving bonus XP</col>, <col=ffffff>Hunter bonus XP</col>, <col=ffffff>in-game perks</col> and <col=ffffff>in-game levels</col>.
param=task_step_1,You can find the game north of <col=ffffff>Falador</col>. Climb the ladder to enter the lobby area.
param=task_step_2,Talk to <col=ffffff>Liara</col> or <col=ffffff>Sir Vyvin</col> to learn the basics of the game.
param=task_step_3,You may play Heist <col=ffffff>as often as you wish</col>.
param=task_step_1_arrow,0_99_99_2_41
param=task_step_2_arrow,0_99_99_2_41
param=task_step_3_arrow,0_99_99_2_41
param=task_auto_arrow,1
param=task_icon,"task_icons_48_60,8"
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3061
param=task_area,0
param=task_next_id,3013
param=task_optional,1
param=challenge_nearest_lodestone,0_46_53_23_12
param=dndtracker_full_description,In this team game, you must choose to side with either the guards or the robbers. The robbers' goal is to trick the guards by taking the form of the locals in order to escape with loot. The guards' goal is to prevent the robbers from succeeding by accusing suspects and making arrests.
param=group_min_players,4
param=group_max_players,10
param=group_rec_players,10
param=group_tele_coord,0_46_53_6_27
param=group_team_enum,group_team_heist
param=group_reward_bespoke,You will gain Reward Points which can be spent on:<br>Hunter and Thieving Bonus experience.<br>In-game perks.<br>Levelling up roles.

