param=bslay_tactic_text,Zamorak will curl up into a ball and begin to channel as much power into a large hit as possible.<br><br>Targets will need to stun Zamorak in order to break him out of this attack. Breaking Zamorak out of <col=FFFFFF>Decimate</col> will cause the attack to be launched at all targets. The longer Zamorak was in his <col=FFFFFF>Decimate</col> attack, the more damage the targets will take.<br><br><col=FFFFFF>40%</col> of this damage will penetrate through defensive and shielding effects, stacking with the <col=E80404>Disintegration</col> hex.<br><br>Damage from this attack is scaled with Enrage %.
