param=rewardshop_obj,rand_reward_farming_conservation_unlocker
param=rewardshop_cost,10000
param=rewardshop_buy_option_1,1
param=rewardshop_usetooltip,1
param=rewardshop_tooltip,Reading this scroll permanently unlocks the Wasteless Farming trait: farmers who harvest patches have a permanent 10% chance of receiving their seeds back. There is also a 5% chance of getting a tree seed back from a dead tree/stump. For herb seeds, the seed type returned may be random.
