param=rewardshop_obj,rand_reward_construction_scroll
param=rewardshop_cost,20000
param=rewardshop_buy_option_1,1
param=rewardshop_usetooltip,1
param=rewardshop_tooltip,Reading this scroll permanently unlocks the Proficient Construction trait: when constructing a piece of furniture that requires three planks or more, there is a chance that you will retain one plank. The chance is 50% for normal planks, 25% for oak, 20% for teak, 10% for mahogany and 5% for protean.
param=rewardshop_requirements,You need level 60 in Dungeoneering and Construction to buy this.
