param=rewardshop_usetooltip,1
param=rewardshop_tooltip,Reading this scroll permanently unlocks the Efficient Crafting trait: when creating an item using Crafting that requires three or more of the same ingredient, there is a chance that you will retain one of that ingredient. The chance is related to the Crafting level required to create that item.
