[task_pop_portsupdate]
param=task_name,Player-Owned Port
param=task_details,Send ships to explore the fabled Eastern Lands and bring back loot and lost knowledge.
param=task_rewards,Experience, and the means to make <col=ffffff>powerful armour</col> and support items.
param=task_step_1,The portal leading to your port is found just north of <col=ffffff>Port Sarim</col>.
param=task_step_2,Anyone can visit the port, but to send ships you must have reached <col=ffffff>level 90</col> in at least one of these skills:
param=task_step_3,<col=ffffff>Fishing</col>, <col=ffffff>Runecrafting</col>, <col=ffffff>Herblore</col>, <col=ffffff>Slayer</col>, <col=ffffff>Thieving</col>, <col=ffffff>Prayer</col>, <col=ffffff>Hunter</col>, <col=ffffff>Cooking</col> or <col=ffffff>Construction</col>.
param=task_step_4,Making many of the rewards requires high levels in <col=ffffff>Smithing</col>, <col=ffffff>Crafting</col>, <col=ffffff>Runecrafting</col>, <col=ffffff>Cooking</col> and <col=ffffff>Fletching</col>.
param=task_step_1_arrow,0_47_50_26_54
param=task_step_2_arrow,0_47_50_26_54
param=task_step_3_arrow,0_47_50_26_54
param=task_step_4_arrow,0_47_50_26_54
param=task_auto_arrow,1
param=task_icon,"task_icons_48_60,8"
param=challenge_nearest_lodestone,0_47_50_3_16
param=task_set,63
param=task_unique_id,3046
param=task_area,0
param=task_next_id,3000
param=dndtracker_full_description,Send ships to explore the fabled Eastern Lands and bring back loot and lost knowledge.
param=task_optional,1

