// 20344
[6awe1_dm_problem1]
param=6awe1_dm_problem_desc,Two crafters, each with a wife and child, have lost their homes in the destruction. There is a damaged house in Lumbridge which could be restored.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a,Restore the house, moving the Zamorakian herbalist in.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b,Restore the house, moving the Saradominist summoner in.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c,Restore the house as a refugee shelter, moving both families in.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d,Leave the house alone.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a_cost,20000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b_cost,20000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c_cost,40000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d_cost,0

// 20345
[6awe1_dm_problem2]
param=6awe1_dm_problem_desc,We could expand our private army to help in the defence of Lumbridge, in case the fighting spills from the crater.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a,Recruit more guardsmen.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b,Form a people's militia.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c,Legitimise the Thieves' Guild in exchange for aid in battle.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d,Do not take any action.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a_cost,30000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b_cost,15000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c_cost,15000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d_cost,0

// 20346
[6awe1_dm_problem3]
param=6awe1_dm_problem_desc,We could request aid from our political allies in other cities.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a,Ask assistance from the White Knights in Falador.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b,Ask assistance from the politically neutral Varrock.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c,Send a delegation to Al Kharid.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d,Do not ask for anyone's help.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a_cost,10000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b_cost,10000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c_cost,25000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d_cost,0

// 20347
[6awe1_dm_problem4]
param=6awe1_dm_problem_desc,Our guardsmen are not currently up to the task of facing the knights and beasts if they leave the battlefield.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a,Improve their weapons.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b,Train them at the Combat Academy.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c,Do both of these.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d,Do not take any action.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a_cost,20000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b_cost,25000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c_cost,45000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d_cost,0

// 20348
[6awe1_dm_problem5]
param=6awe1_dm_problem_desc,Should we request magical protection for the town and castle?
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a,Bring in ZMI mages.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b,Ask the druids for wardsmen.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c,Ask Papa Mambo for help.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d,Do not get anyone involved.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a_cost,10000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b_cost,10000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c_cost,20000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d_cost,0

// 20349
[6awe1_dm_problem6]
param=6awe1_dm_problem_desc,A famous trainer offers us his services to train war beasts to guard Lumbridge.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a,Train guard dogs.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b,Train guard rats.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c,Train guard spiders.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d,Refuse his services.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a_cost,20000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b_cost,15000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c_cost,25000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d_cost,0

// 20350
[6awe1_dm_problem7]
param=6awe1_dm_problem_desc,The graveyard south of Lumbridge is becoming overfull due to the carnage on the battlefield.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a,Expand with additional grave plots.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b,Expand with a mass grave.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c,Expand with a mass grave, and bring in a priest to bless it.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d,Inter the bodies in the catacombs.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a_cost,25000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b_cost,5000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c_cost,15000
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d_cost,0

// 20351
[6awe1_dm_problem8]
param=6awe1_dm_problem_desc,The battle is coming to a head. If we have any spare money, we could consider aiding one or other side.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a,Send aid to Saradomin.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b,Send aid to Zamorak.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c,Send aid to both sides equally.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d,Spend the money on food aid for Lumbridge.
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_a_cost,1
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_b_cost,1
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_c_cost,1
param=6awe1_dm_problem_option_d_cost,1

