param=worldmap_upsell_content_caption_1_text,Barrows
param=worldmap_upsell_content_caption_2_text,Slayer Tower
param=worldmap_upsell_content_text,Sunlight doesn't reach Morytania. It is in perpetual darkness. This has drawn vampyres, werewolves, ghouls and ghosts to its lands, and humans are nothing more than prey.
