// 28871
[bslay_dungeon_ulthven3_seiryu]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Seiryu's Intervention
param=bslay_tactic_text,As the Ambassador continues to summon in floods of invulnerable Crassian Ritual Keepers, with seemingly no way to defeat them, Seiryu intervenes. After appearing at the side of the arena, Seiryu will <col=FFFFFF>fully heal</col> all players and use a <col=FFFFFF>Deep Breath</col> attack to destroy the Crassians.
param=bslay_tactic_new_npc,dungeon_ulthven_boss3_seiryu

// 28872
[bslay_dungeon_ulthven3_hands]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Circle of Black Hands
param=bslay_tactic_text,In his fury, Kranon decides to call upon Xau-Tak for the final phase of the fight. This causes 12 Black Hands to appear and they immediate begin projecting dark magic towards Kranon in order to heal him and empower him.<br><br>It is possible to intercept the projectiles, causing minor <col=FFFFFF>typeless</col> damage to yourself instead of allowing them to heal the Ambassador.
param=bslay_tactic_new_npc,dungeon_ulthven_boss3_xautak

