param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_x,37
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc2_z,30
param=dom_arena_type,4
param=dom_boss_desc,Riven with insanity, driven by evil, infused with chaos. This duo of dwarves tried to take over Keldagrim and lost, but not without a fight!<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Birthright of the Dwarves<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Expect an extremly hard fight! Grimsson is a powerful warrior in his own right, and can charge you for massive damage and hurl his allies at you. Hreidmar will attack with magic from a distance. He will also summon allies that he can heal, buff and detonate to deal you damage.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,
param=dom_boss_2_taunt,
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,ra5_hreidmar_attack_3
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,ra5_hreidmar_attack_3
