param=dom_boss_id,60
param=dom_boss_npc_safe_1,dom_boss_nial_safe
param=dom_boss_npc_combat_1,dom_boss_nial_combat
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_x,37
param=dom_npc_spawn_npc1_z,31
param=dom_arena_type,2
param=dom_boss_desc,Nial Swiftfling was a Fremennik warrior, but has been turned into a terrible yeti. He has, however, lost none of his warrior's skill.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Glorious Memories<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Nial will attack in close combat. At range he will hurl axes with the same accuracy and speed that gained him his last name. As a terrible yeti, he also has the ability to roar with such force that you may be flung back several paces.
param=dom_boss_1_taunt,Raargh!
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_english,dom_rework_yeti_roar
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_german,dom_rework_yeti_roar
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_french,dom_rework_yeti_roar
param=dom_boss_taunt_sound_portuguese,dom_rework_yeti_roar
