param=bslay_tactic_text,Torag will try to locate Ahrim, Karil, or Verac to throw them. If successful, he'll <col=E6DCB4>Surge</col> over to them and throw them to a random nearby location, inflicting damage to anyone near where they land.<br>
param=bslay_tactic_new_npc,barrows2_torag
