// 31972
[raid1_goebie_miniquest_1]
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_string,The Airut are encroaching on our land to the west. Please could you help us fight them off by killing 10 of them?
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_npc_name,raid1_goebie_quest_combat_npc_1
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_npc_amount,10

// 31973
[raid1_goebie_miniquest_2]
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_string,The Airut attacked our camp during the night, we need to rebuild. Could you help by salvaging 5 scraps from the tents they ruined?
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_obj_name,raid1_goebie_miniquest_scraps
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_obj_amount,5

// 31974
[raid1_goebie_miniquest_3]
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_string,The fences around Kanatah have been torn apart in an Airut ambush, it would really help us if you could repair 10 of them.
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_loc_name,raid1_goebie_defences_broken_1
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_loc_amount,10

// 31975
[raid1_goebie_miniquest_4]
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_string,The path to our village has been blocked by fallen rocks, it would take too long for us to move them. Could you clear 10 for us?
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_loc_name,raid1_goebie_miniquest_rocks
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_loc_amount,10

// 31976
[raid1_goebie_miniquest_5]
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_string,We need to light the signal beacon on the edge of Nemi forest to the west so we can send for help from Village Otot. Could you do it for us?
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_loc_name,raid1_goebie_beacon_unlit
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_loc_amount,1

// 31977
[raid1_goebie_miniquest_6]
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_string,Since we lost village Cotoch lots of driftwood has washed up on the shore to the east. If you could collect 10 for us we could use it to rebuild!
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_obj_name,raid1_goebie_miniquest_driftwood
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_obj_amount,10

// 31978
[raid1_goebie_miniquest_7]
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_string,I need to scribble a mark on your hand to take to Acca Otot. It's urgent, he'll know what it means.
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_npc_name,raid1_otot_elder
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_npc_amount,1

// 31979
[raid1_goebie_miniquest_8]
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_string,The Airut have taken our friends, they want to enslave them! Please, go to their camp in the west. Free our friends and take vengeance on their captors!
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_npc_name,raid1_goebie_quest_combat_npc_1
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_npc_amount,5
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_loc_name,raid1_goebie_miniquest_cage
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_loc_amount,5

// 31980
[raid1_goebie_miniquest_9]
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_string,I've heard rumour there is a traitor among us. He fled into Nemi forest when he was found. Please, hunt him down and deal with him.
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_npc_name,raid1_goebie_traitor
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_npc_amount,1

// 31981
[raid1_goebie_miniquest_10]
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_string,Some of our elders have fallen sick. We need the fruit from a Pahtli plant if we are to have any hope of saving them. Please find one in Nemi forest!
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_obj_name,raid1_goebie_miniquest_fruit
param=raid1_goebie_miniquest_subtask_obj_amount,1

