// 35394
[bslay_vindicta_intro]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Vindicta & Gorvek
param=bslay_tactic_text,Representing Zaros as General, the deadly duo of Vindicta & Gorvek await any players who step forward.

// 35395
[bslay_vindicta_ranged]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Phase 1 - Ranged attack
param=bslay_tactic_text,If Vindicta is unable to attack the player she will use her ranged attack.

// 35396
[bslay_vindicta_dragonfire]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Phase 1 - Dragonfire
param=bslay_tactic_text,After a few attacks and raising her sword in the air, Vindicta will call on Gorvek to unleash dragonfire on her target, dealing rapid magic damage.

// 35397
[bslay_vindicta_gorvek]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Phase 2 - Gorvek
param=bslay_tactic_text,Upon dropping to a certain amount of lifepoints Vindicta will mount Gorvek, during this time a mix of melee and ranged attacks follow.
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_zaros_general_grounded_call_dragon

// 35398
[bslay_vindicta_dragonfirewall]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Phase 2 - Dragonfire wall
param=bslay_tactic_text,Once the melee and ranged attacks have finished, Gorvek comes down from above and leaves a trail of dragonfire.
param=bslay_tactic_new_npc,gwd2_zaros_boss_gorvek
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_zaros_general_dragon_breathe_fire
param=bslay_tactic_spotanim,gwd2_zaros_general_dragon_breathe_fire_spotanim

// 35399
[bslay_vindicta_phase3cm]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Phase 3 - Hard Mode
param=bslay_tactic_text,In Hard Mode, Vindicta and Gorvek have a combined total of 600,000 lifepoints making them a formidable boss to take on. During Hard Mode they will also attack faster resulting in higher damage per second.

// 35400
[bslay_twindemons_avaryss]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Avaryss
