// 35454
[bslay_twindemons_raindeath]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Rain Death
param=bslay_tactic_text,Nymora begins to charge up a special attack, during this time spikes will fall from the ceiling covering the entire arena except for the area Nymora is in.
param=bslay_tactic_new_npc,gwd2_zam_boss_ranged
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_zamorak_general_rain_death
param=bslay_tactic_spotanim,gwd2_zamorak_general_rain_death_spotanim

// 35455
[bslay_twindemons_burnphase]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Burn Phase
param=bslay_tactic_text,The Arena around the Twin Furies will be engulfed in flames as they link up and begin to charge up a highly explosive attack, during this time the Twin Furies are more vulnerable to attacks.
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_zamorak_general_black_burn_phase
param=bslay_tactic_spotanim,gwd2_zamorak_general_black_burn_phase_spotanim

// 35456
[bslay_twindemons_burnexplode]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Burn Phase (Explosion)
param=bslay_tactic_text,As the Burn Phase is ongoing, a bar will start to degrade above the Twin Furies heads, once depleted the Furies will emit a huge and powerful explosion.
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_zamorak_general_burn_explosion
param=bslay_tactic_spotanim,gwd2_zamorak_general_burn_explosion_spotanim

// 35457
[bslay_twindemons_cmbomb]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Lava Bomb: Hard Mode
param=bslay_tactic_text,A Lava Bomb will bounce around the arena, dealing large damage to anything it touches and exploding on the last bounce, keep an eye out for a green marker which informs you where the Lava Bomb will land.

// 35458
[bslay_twindemons_cmbluebomb]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Lava Bomb (Blue): Hard Mode
param=bslay_tactic_text,At times a Blue Lava Bomb will appear in the arena, this has a different effect to the normal Lava Bombs, if the player stands underneath the Blue Bomb as it hits them it will reflect on to the Twin Furies dealing damage to them.<br><br>However, if the player is unable to reflect the Blue Bomb back to the Twin Furies after a few attempts the Blue Bomb will lock on to a player and deal high damage.

// 35459
[bslay_helwyr_intro]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Helwyr
param=bslay_tactic_text,A general of Seren's army, Helwyr uses elven magic to draw upon the energy of the creature he possesses.

// 35460
[bslay_helwyr_nature]
param=bslay_tactic_title,The aid of Nature
param=bslay_tactic_text,During the fight Helywr may call upon nature to help him out, at this moment three gas-puffing mushrooms appear (six if you're in Hard mode) and will deal damage if you are near them.

// 35461
[bslay_helwyr_rake]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Rake
param=bslay_tactic_text,Helwyr uses his claws to rake an area in front of him dealing bleed damage to you if you're hit by it.
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_seren_general_attack_rake
param=bslay_tactic_spotanim,gwd2_seren_general_attack_rake_spotanim

// 35462
[bslay_helwyr_rend]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Rend
param=bslay_tactic_text,When Rend is in effect any attack Helwyr strikes with will cause bleed damage, the bleed effect will stack on top of Rake.

// 35463
[bslay_helwyr_thrash]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Thrash
param=bslay_tactic_text,Helwyr pounces a random player and thrashes around, biting and clawing everything around
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_seren_general_attack_thrash

// 35464
[bslay_helwyr_howl]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Cywir Alphas
param=bslay_tactic_text,Helwyr calls in a pack of Cywir Alphas, these deal quick damage and should be killed quickly to avoid losing life.
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_seren_general_howl
param=bslay_tactic_spotanim,gwd2_seren_general_howl_spotanim

// 35465
[bslay_sliske_intro]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Gregorovic
param=bslay_tactic_text,Gregorovic is the general of Sliske's army, possessing accurate and high-damage attacks.

// 35466
[bslay_sliske_attack]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Attack
param=bslay_tactic_text,Using his glaives, Gregorovic can utilize <col=FFFFFF>melee</col> and <col=FFFFFF>ranged</col> attacks, Gregorovic is also capable of poisoning the player in quick intervals.
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_sliske_general_attack

// 35467
[bslay_sliske_spirit]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Spirits
param=bslay_tactic_text,Gregorovic summons a Spirit of Rage, Spirit of Delirium or Spirit of Mania from the respective masks depending on where Gregorovic is positioned when he uses that ability, if you're fighting Gregorovic in Hard Mode two spirits will be spawned instead of one.

// 35468
[bslay_sliske_glaives]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Glaives
param=bslay_tactic_text,Gregorovic will toss both of his glaives into the air, shadows will appear throughout the arena in a scattered formation. After two seconds, daggers and knives will fall from the ceiling and deal magic damage onto the player.
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_sliske_general_ranged

// 35469
[bslay_sliske_shadow]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Shadow Clones
param=bslay_tactic_text,Upon reaching a certain threshold of lifepoints, Gregorovic will summon 2/3 shadows, these shadows have a small amount of lifepoints, while the shadows are alive Gregorovic can swap places with the shadow copies.
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_sliske_general_shadow_cast
param=bslay_tactic_spotanim,gwd2_sliske_general_shadow_cast_spotanim

// 35470
[bslay_gwd2_solo_boss_phase_one]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Phase one - Awakening
param=bslay_tactic_text,Telos awakens, and begins the fight with 4 main abilities.
param=bslay_tactic_new_npc,gwd2_solo_boss

// 35471
[bslay_gwd2_solo_boss_beam_green]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Beam of pure anima
param=bslay_tactic_text,A green beam of anima will appear across the platform. Standing inside the beam will increase adrenaline gain, whilst draining prayer points. Telos' anima will increase faster if it is standing in the beam.

// 35472
[bslay_gwd2_solo_boss_tendrils]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Siphoning tendrils
param=bslay_tactic_text,Telos will channel a tendril attack which drains adrenaline. Whilst the tendril is being channeled, Telos will both heal, and rapidly gain anima. The channel can be broken by dealing damage.
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_solo_boss_siphon

// 35473
[bslay_gwd2_solo_boss_stun_jump]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Double tap
param=bslay_tactic_text,Telos will deal <col=FFFFFF>melee</col> damage that stuns the target, followed up by a jump dealing typeless damage.
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_solo_boss_double_tap

// 35474
[bslay_gwd2_solo_boss_energy_sword]
param=bslay_tactic_title,Energy sword
param=bslay_tactic_text,Telos will charge his sword with energy, and perform a slice dealing high typeless damage.
param=bslay_tactic_animation,gwd2_solo_boss_energy_sword

