param=cheevo_rewards,Tirannwn quiver 4 and 3 magic lamps, worth a total of 160,000 XP in skills of your choice.<br>Permanent, passive benefits:<br>- Weekly logs from Coeden; a chance to not use charges on a most wanted card; 5% damage boost against dark beasts.<br>- 5% chance of not using a charge on your attuned crystal bow and wards.<br>- Double the blossoms harvested from the crystal acorn tree.<br>While wearing the quiver:<br>- Ability to take a portrait at the photo booth with the head of one of the 8 elf lords.
param=cheevo_icon,"shields,95"
