param=cheevo_rewards,Karamja gloves 4 and a set of magic lamps worth a total of 140,000xp in three skills of your choice.<br>The gloves gain the following extra benefits:<br>- 25% chance of receiving double tickets in Brimhaven Agility Arena.<br>- Once per day, if I am killed in the Fight Cave/Pit, I will be resurrected on the spot.<br>Double damage against wild dogs in Brimhaven Dungeon, and access to a shortcut to the red dragon area of the dungeon.<br>Lapalok will give me more Slayer points.<br>The TzHaar banker will give me a lump sum of 150,000 Tok-Kul.<br>Once per week, Dell Monti will give me 140 apples.<br>I can now use the shortcut into Shilo village.
param=cheevo_icon,"shields,23"
param=cheevo_meta_list,cheevo_karamja_elite
param=cheevo_meta_list_type,0
param=cheevo_is_meta,1
param=cheevo_unique_id,1336
param=cheevo_meta_id,1702
param=cheevo_runescore,25

