param=cheevo_rewards,Seers' headband 2 and a magic lamp worth 5,000 XP in a skill of your choice. The coal trucks at the Seers' Village coal mine will now hold 280 coal.<br>The headband gains the following extra benefits:<br>- 10% bonus experience when cutting maple trees.<br>- Faster spinning when using the spinning wheel in Seers' Village.<br>Geoffrey in the flax field near Seers' Village will give you 420 flax per week.
