param=cheevo_rewards,Seers' headband 3 and a magic lamp worth 10,000 XP in a skill of your choice. The coal trucks at the Seers' Village coal mine will now hold 308 coal."<br>The headband gains the following extra benefits:<br>- Thormac at the Sorcerer's Tower will enchant mystic staves for 27,000 coins instead of 40,000.<br>- The Lady of the Lake will enhance Excalibur for you.<br>Talk to any seer to change your Camelot Teleport destination to the centre of Seers' Village.<br>The Seers' Village altar will give a boost to Prayer.<br>Geoffrey in the flax field near Seers' Village will give you 840 flax per week.
