param=cheevo_rewards,Varrock armour 2 and a magic lamp worth 5,000XP in a skill of your choice.<br>The armour gains the following extra benefits:<br>- +3% chance for double smelting mithril, adamant.<br>- +3% chance for double ore mining mithril, adamantite, luminite.<br>- +3% chance for double progress smithing mithril, adamant.<br>- Further improved chance of receiving a skull sceptre piece in the Stronghold of Security.<br>- Skull sceptres have additional charges if assembled while wearing the armour.<br>Naff will sell up to 32 battlestaves a day.
