param=cbtv2ca_course_description,Learn about attack styles and how to inspect a weapon to determine its style. Learn how to inspect an enemy and determine their weakness.<br><br>Demonstration:<br>Attack a set of skeletons with the correct attack style.<br><br>Hover over the rank icons to see completion requirements.
param=cbtv2ca_course_gold,#1 Legend Rank<br><br>Attack the skeleton that is naturally weak to the weapon provided most of the time.
param=cbtv2ca_course_silver,#2 Hero Rank<br><br>Attack the skeleton that is naturally weak to the weapon provided some of the time.
param=cbtv2ca_course_bronze,#3 Champion Rank<br><br>Attack a skeleton, rarely or never picking the skeleton that is naturally weak to the weapon provided.
param=cbtv2ca_course_label,storablelabel_7
param=cheevo_name,Combat Academy #4 - Styles & Weaknesses
param=cheevo_icon,rs3_icon_path_combat
