param=task_step_2,You will also need 1 <col=0xF0BE79>mind rune</col>. The magic shop in Varrock sells these.
param=task_step_3,Open your <col=0xF0BE79>Magic Spellbook</col> and locate the <col=0xF0BE79>Confuse</col> combat spell.
