param=task_step_1,Acquire a raw herring by fishing or by buying it.
param=task_step_2,To fish for herring, use a rod and bait at a saltwater bait fishing spot with at least <col=0xF0BE79>10 Fishing</col>.
param=task_step_3,Use your <col=0xF0BE79>raw herring</col> on a <col=0xF0BE79>range</col> or <col=0xF0BE79>fire</col> with at least <col=0xF0BE79>5 Cooking</col>.
param=task_step_4,It is possible to burn your herring by mistake, so you may wish to bring several.
param=task_requirement_1_type,16
param=task_requirement_1_value,5
param=task_optional,1
param=cheevo_popup,false

// 38060
[cheevo_path_cast_enchant1]
param=cheevo_name,Absolutely Enchanting
param=cheevo_details,Successfully cast Level-1 Enchant on an item of jewellery.
param=cheevo_icon,"task_icons_12_24,6"
param=cheevo_unique_id,404
param=cheevo_game,1
param=task_step_1_arrow,0_50_50_4_41
param=task_step_1,You will need level <col=0xF0BE79>7 Magic</col> to cast this spell.
param=task_step_2,You will also need a 1 <col=0xF0BE79>water rune</col> and 1 <col=0xF0BE79>cosmic rune</col>, and an item of <col=0xF0BE79>sapphire jewellery</col> to cast it on.
param=task_step_3,The magic shop in Varrock sells water runes.
param=task_step_4,Completing the achievement <col=0xF0BE79>Not So Confusing After All</col> will allow you to claim a <col=0xF0BE79>sapphire amulet</col> and a <col=0xF0BE79>cosmic rune</col> from <col=0xF0BE79>Explorer Jack</col> in <col=0xF0BE79>Lumbridge</col>, or any other taskmaster.
param=task_step_5,Open your <col=0xF0BE79>Magic Spellbook</col> and locate the <col=0xF0BE79>Lvl-1 Enchant</col> skilling spell.
param=task_step_6,<col=0xF0BE79>Left-click</col> <col=0xF0BE79>Lvl-1 Enchant</col>, then <col=0xF0BE79>left-click</col> the <col=0xF0BE79>jewellery</col> you wish to enchant.
param=task_step_6_mobile,<col=0xF0BE79>Tap</col> <col=0xF0BE79>Lvl-1 Enchant</col>, then <col=0xF0BE79>tap</col> the <col=0xF0BE79>jewellery</col> you wish to enchant.
param=task_step_7,Free players can only enchant amulets.
param=task_information,Enchanted jewellery has a wide range of effects including teleports, smelting assistance, damage reflection in combat and even improved luck.
param=task_requirement_1_type,4
param=task_requirement_1_value,7
param=task_optional,1
param=cheevo_popup,false

