param=cheevo_details,Create a sign.
param=cheevo_icon,"aif_omge_quest_icons_01,20"
param=cheevo_unique_id,1141
param=task_step_1,Get some energy of the appropriate tier and additional materials as described in the Divination section of the skill guide.
param=task_step_2,Click on the energy and choose a sign to create.
param=task_step_2_mobile,Tap the energy and choose a sign to create.
param=task_step_3,Creating signs has various requirements. As you get more proficient you can create higher-level items.
param=task_information,Most signs must be equipped to take effect. When equipped, the signs will sit passively until they are required. For example, the sign of life will only activate on death. Experiment with different types of sign to discover their uses.
param=task_requirement_1_type,26
param=task_requirement_1_value,6
param=cheevo_meta_id,1989
param=cheevo_meta_id_2,1700
param=cheevo_runescore,5

