param=task_step_2,Click on the energy and choose a boon to unlock.
param=task_step_2_mobile,Tap the energy and choose a boon to unlock.
param=task_step_3,Different boons have different requirements to create. As you get more proficient you can unlock higher level boons.
param=task_information,Unlocking a boon means you will get a 10% higher yield for both energy and experience for that tier. For example, the flickering boon means you will gain 10% more energy or 10% more XP when converting flickering memories. You may only unlock a boon once, as its effects are permanent.
