param=task_step_2,Talk to <col=ffffff>Wizard Finix</col> in <col=ffffff>the Runespan</col>, accessed from the top of the Wizards' Tower for more information.
param=task_step_3,Other wizards in the Runespan can help you find the Runesphere when it has appeared.
param=task_step_4,You can hand in up to <col=ffffff>1,000 rune dust</col> each day.
