param=trh_promo_clearup,6122
param=trh_event_name,Slime is of the essence
param=trh_event_desc,The King Slime has arisen, spreading goo and terror throughout Rimmington! This is how Peter, the Cook, knew he messed up. Speak with him out to learn what happened and how to repel this menacing monstrosity! Use different skills each day for slick rewards, like the Slime Hunter Armour, a Slime Pet, and more! Ran out of tools to repel the slime? Win more from Treasure Hunter or buy them with Loyalty Points from Peter."
param=trh_promo_free_prizes,trh152_promo_free_prizes
param=trh_promo_free_prizes_quantity,trh152_promo_free_prizes_count
param=trh_promo_free_prizes_message,You have obtained 2 free golden tools for use in the Slime is of the essence event! You can win more from Treasure Hunter while the event is active!
