param=cheevo_details_mobile,Long-press the run energy button on your minimap and choose 'Rest' to quickly regenerate your run energy.
param=task_information,Your <col=0xF0BE79>Agility</col> skill level determines how fast you regenerate run energy.<br>Running is roughly twice as fast as walking, but requires run energy.<br>Run energy replenishes on its own, but will return faster if you rest.
param=cheevo_icon,"staticons_high_res_clean,7"
