param=task_step_1,There is a <col=0xF0BE79>bank chest</col> at the <col=0xF0BE79>market</col> north of Lumbridge castle and general store.
param=task_step_2,Left-click a <col=0xF0BE79>bank chest</col>, <col=0xF0BE79>bank booth</col> or <col=0xF0BE79>banker</col> to view your <col=0xF0BE79>bank</col>.
