// 44873
[skilling_offhand_measure_effect]
param=combatv2_ability_info,The Efficient Crafting and Proficient Construction traits, from the scrolls of dexterity and proficiency, have a 25% increased chance to occur.<br>Whenever either trait occurs, you gain 'Artificer's Focus', granting you 0.5% increased experience in Crafting and Construction for 5 minutes. This effect stacks up to 10 times.<br>While glassblowing or crafting urns, you have a 5% chance to create a duplicate product.<br>While training at harmonium harps, the Ithell clan blessing is always active.

// 44874
[skilling_offhand_furnace_effect]
param=combatv2_ability_info,The Efficient Smithing trait from the scroll of efficiency has a 25% increased chance to occur.<br>Forge phoenixes will appear instead of fire spirits, and can be summoned while Smithing.<br>Superheat form does not require prayer points.<br>Whenever the pyromaniac or breakdown perks activate, you gain 'Furnace Core', granting you 5% increased experience in Firemaking and Smithing for 5 minutes.

