param=mtx_front_end_confirm_details_override,This bundle contains:<br>- Rock of Resilience (+15 charges for the rock)<br>- 2 x Aura refresh<br>- 2 x Life refresh<br>- 2 x Item protection contract<br>- 2 x box of clue scrolls (untradeable)<br>- 10 x Advanced pulse core<br>- 10 x Cinder core<br>- 50 x Protean bar, plank, cog, trap, hide, log, memory, shake, protein and essence <br>- 4 x medium skill training dummy crate<br><br>The Rock of Resilience grants you a 4% XP boost and those around you a 2% XP boost for 60 minutes per charge. This can be used once a day.
