// 50170
[smithing_armour_spikes_tooltip]
param=combatv2_ability_info,Deals damage equal to 100% of Smithing level to any attackers adjacent to you. While wielding a shield, this damage is doubled.
param=combatv2_ability_info_ondamage_activation,1

// 50171
[primal_armour_spikes_tooltip]
param=combatv2_ability_info,Deals damage equal to 125% of Smithing level to any attackers adjacent to you, or using melee. 10% chance your armour spikes will deal +1,000% damage. While wielding a shield, this damage is doubled.
param=combatv2_ability_info_ondamage_activation,1

// 50172
[smithing_armour_spikes_upgraded_tooltip]
param=combatv2_ability_info,Deals damage equal to 100% of Smithing level to any attackers adjacent to you, or using melee. 10% chance your armour spikes will deal +900% damage. While wielding a shield, this damage is doubled.
param=combatv2_ability_info_ondamage_activation,1

// 50173
[combatv2_abyssal_spikes_upgraded_tooltip]
param=combatv2_ability_info,Deals damage equal to 100% of Smithing level to any attackers adjacent to you, or using melee. 10% chance your armour spikes will deal +900% damage. While wielding a shield, this damage is doubled.<br><br>On spike damaging an enemy: Apply a stack of parasite to deal 5 times 18-31 bleed damage over 9 seconds. Each additional activation within this timeframe adds another stack of parasites and restarts the effect, capping at 937-1562 damage per hit. If an enemy dies with the parasites affecting them, 50% of them will spread to all nearby enemies (does not work in PvP).
param=combatv2_ability_info_ondamage_activation,1

// 50174
[primal_abyssal_spikes_tooltip]
param=combatv2_ability_info,Deals damage equal to 125% of Smithing level to any attackers adjacent to you, or using melee. 10% chance your armour spikes will deal +1,000% damage. While wielding a shield, this damage is doubled.<br><br>On spike damaging an enemy: Apply a stack of parasite to deal 5 times 18-31 bleed damage over 9 seconds. Each additional activation within this timeframe adds another stack of parasites and restarts the effect, capping at 937-1562 damage per hit. If an enemy dies with the parasites affecting them, 50% of them will spread to all nearby enemies (does not work in PvP).
param=combatv2_ability_info_ondamage_activation,1

