// 50208
[elidinis_boss_skilling_offhand_runecrafting_effect]
param=combatv2_ability_name,Runic Attunement
param=combatv2_ability_info,<br>Attunes itself to a random runecrafting altar when crafting runes. Excludes Necromancy altars. <br>Runecrafting at the attuned altar grants <col=0x00ff00>+50%</col> Runecrafting XP and causes the attuner to absorb energy: <br>-Every <col=0x00ffff>1 energy</col>: Increased chance to attune to higher level altars.<br>-Every <col=0x00ffff>1 energy</col>: When entering the Abyss, you will arrive close to the attuned altar's rift once.<br>- Every <col=0x00ffff>5 energy</col>: <col=0x00ff00>+50%</col> runes crafted.<br>- Every <col=0x00ffff>7 energy</col>: Attunes itself to all altars.<br>- Every <col=0x00ffff>10 energy</col>: Can teleport to an attuned altar.<br>- Every <col=0x00ffff>25 energy</col>: Guarantee 1-4 magical thread.<br>- Every <col=0x00ffff>50 Energy</col>: Runecrafting XP bonus increases from <col=0x00ff00>+50% to +2,200%</col> and absorbed energy is released.<br>

// 50209
[elidinis_boss_skilling_offhand_divination_effect]
param=combatv2_ability_name,Memory Attraction
param=combatv2_ability_info,<br>Memories can be gathered from wisps from 7 tiles away.<br>Whilst standing within 2 tiles of an Energy Rift:<br>- Gathered memories are automatically deposited into the energy rift.<br>- +15% chance to receive double memories.<br>- +15 seconds duration to energy springs.

// 50210
[elidinis_boss_offerings_amulet]
