param=marketplace_spotlight_membership_discount,0
param=mtx_front_end_confirm_details_override,The small pack contains:<br>- Golden dragonwing scimitars (cosmetic overrides)<br>- 3 Large skill training dummy crates<br>- 1000 Assorted unstable proteans<br>- 2 Small knowledge bombs<br>- 10 Medium prismatic stars<br><br>The medium pack contains:<br>- Golden mage robes (cosmetic overrides)<br>- 6 Large skill training dummy crates<br>- 2000 Assorted unstable proteans<br>- 6 Small knowledge bombs<br>- 10 Large prismatic stars<br>- 1 Umbral chest<br><br> The large pack contains:<br>- Golden Torva armour, Golden dragonwing scimitars, Golden mage robes (cosmetic overrides)<br>- 1 Golden Cosmetic Token (used to unlock 1 previous golden item as a cosmetic override)<br>- 15 Large skill training dummy crates<br>- 4000 Assorted unstable proteans<br>- 15 Small knowledge bombs<br>- 10 Huge prismatic stars<br>- 2 Umbral chests
param=mtx_front_end_confirm_restrictions_override,Each pack can only be purchased once.<br>Ironmen will only receive Cosmetic items.<br>Available until the 8th April 2025.

